Regression Suites

33 YAML scenarios run by the Resonance runner, not by this
repo itself. Each file's header comment states what it proves.

Paths

  Runner plus SUT binaries live in a Resonance checkout:
  <resonance>/bin/rsuite, <resonance>/bin/concord, plus
  <resonance>/certs seeded per node and <resonance>/img/rootfs
  for pushed test images. Scenarios live here:
  <concord>/rsuite/*.yaml. Logs land under /var/tmp in a fresh
  per-run dir and persist; see <resonance>/docs/layout.

Build (from the Resonance checkout)

  make bin/rsuite
  cd deps/concord && go build -o ../../bin/concord ./cmd/concord
  make img-build

deps/concord is a reference checkout, never edited in place;
the Makefile owns no Concord target. img-build needs Go and
fills img/rootfs with probe, probe-check, and hog; img and
preempt (hog push) need those bins at run time.

Lint, list, doctor (no privileges, from Resonance checkout)

  ./bin/rsuite lint <concord>/rsuite/*.yaml
  ./bin/rsuite lint <concord>/rsuite/concord_two.yaml
  ./bin/rsuite list <concord>/rsuite/*.yaml
  ./bin/rsuite doctor

make lint only covers Resonance suite/examples; Concord files
need explicit paths as above.

Run (needs root for netns plus TUN, from Resonance checkout)

  sudo ./bin/rsuite run --jobs 4 <concord>/rsuite/*.yaml
  sudo ./bin/rsuite run <concord>/rsuite/concord_two.yaml

With sibling checkouts that reads:

  sudo ./bin/rsuite run --jobs 4 ../concord/rsuite/*.yaml

One child runs per file even at jobs 1. Flags precede files.
Exit is 0 ok, 1 suite failure, 2 bad usage; skips never fail
the run. Each run keeps per-file <base>.log plus report.html
in its run dir; failed files copy journals plus node logs
aside before the statedir wipe. Nothing cleans logs; remove
them by hand when done. Post-mortem order plus cleanup live
in <resonance>/docs/troubleshoot under post-mortem and the
stale-state recipe.
